<title>FRANCE: Scor 1996 net attrib up 19.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Scor 1996 net attrib up 19.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     624  vs	     522</p>
<p>    Net per share (francs)		   23.00  vs	   19.31</p>
<p>    Net dividend				 10.00  vs	    5.00</p>
<p>    Gross premiums			    13,814  vs	  11,848</p>
<p>    Net premiums				12,134  vs	  10,184</p>
<p>    Shareholders funds			 5,869  vs	   5,146</p>
<p>    Investments				 31,957  vs	  26,818</p>
<p>NOTE - Scor Group gave its results in a newspaper advertisement.  </p>
<p>The above results were consolidated according to French GAAP rules.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
